---
---

<div class="mock-mac-browser" id="macBrowserMockup" role="img" aria-label="Ilustrasi browser dengan portal BPJS Ketenagakerjaan dan panel asisten AIRA di sisi kanan">
  <div class="mock-mac-chrome" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mock-mac-chrome-top">
      <div class="mac-traffic-dots">
        <span class="mac-dot mac-dot-red"></span>
        <span class="mac-dot mac-dot-yellow"></span>
        <span class="mac-dot mac-dot-green"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="mac-tab-chip">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
          <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" />
        </svg>
        <span>bpjsketenagakerjaan.go.id</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mock-mac-address-row">
      <div class="mac-nav-icons">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12" />
          <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5" />
        </svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
        </svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10" />
          <path d="M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="mac-url-pill">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2" />
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" />
        </svg>
        <span>bpjsketenagakerjaan.go.id</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mac-ext-badge" title="Ekstensi AIRA Aktif">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z" />
        </svg>
        <span class="brand-aira"><em>A</em>IRA</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mock-mac-viewport">
    <div class="bpjs-host-page" id="bpjsPortal" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="bpjs-top-nav">
        <div class="bpjs-logo-brand">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#00875A" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" />
          </svg>
          <div class="bpjs-brand-text">
            <span class="name-bpjs">BPJS</span>
            <span class="name-sub">Ketenagakerjaan</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bpjs-nav-links" id="bpjsNavMenu">
          <span>Informasi Kepesertaan</span>
          <span>Cara Klaim</span>
          <span>Berita</span>
          <span style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" />
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
            </svg>
            ID
          </span>
          <span style="width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; cursor:pointer;">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
              <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6" />
              <line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12" />
              <line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bpjs-banner-card">
        <h2>Pendaftaran Antrean Layanan Kantor Cabang</h2>
        <p>
          Selamat datang di portal pelayanan digital terpadu. Silakan pastikan data identitas kependudukan dan
          kepesertaan Anda sudah siap sebelum mengisi formulir di bawah ini.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bpjs-content-card">
        <h3>Informasi Persyaratan Dokumen</h3>
        <p>
          Berdasarkan peraturan jaminan sosial tenaga kerja, peserta yang hendak mengajukan klaim JHT (Jaminan Hari
          Tua) atau pengurusan kepesertaan wajib melampirkan:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Kartu Tanda Penduduk Elektronik (e-KTP) asli dan fotokopi.</li>
          <li>Kartu Peserta Jamsostek / BPJS Ketenagakerjaan (KPJ).</li>
          <li>Buku Rekening Bank aktif atas nama peserta bersangkutan.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bpjs-content-card">
        <h3>Langkah 1: Identifikasi Peserta</h3>
        <label for="bpjsNikInput" class="bpjs-input-label">Nomor Induk Kependudukan (NIK KTP)</label>
        <input type="text" id="bpjsNikInput" class="bpjs-form-input" value="3201015609920002" readonly tabindex="-1" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <slot />
  </div>
</div>
